# in this repo can consume: this manifest's grammar is scoop/winget/choco ids
# only, and from-url can DOWNLOAD a file but never unpack or install one.
#
# TODO -- and it needs a decision, not a row. Landing it requires exactly one of:
#   (a) a Windows-side unzip-to-PATH mechanism (new mechanism -- needs sign-off),
