#       we would be contributing Yubico's package to microsoft/winget-pkgs), or
#   (c) accepting Windows as documented-manual for the HSM.
# NO sha256 is stated here on purpose: the only digest available would be one I
# computed from a download I could not independently verify, which is
# trust-on-first-download wearing a pin's clothes. Yubico's .sig is the real
